          "nl": "Toon [[what]] [[detail]] op scherm [[screen]] gedurende [[seconds]] seconden"
        },
        "hint": {
          "en": "Leave the screen empty for all screens. Detail: the name of a storey, or the text of a message. 0 seconds: until someone taps.",
          "nl": "Laat het scherm leeg voor alle schermen. Detail: de naam van een verdieping, of de tekst van een bericht. 0 seconden: tot iemand tikt."
        },
        "args": [
          {
            "type": "dropdown",
            "name": "what",
            "title": {
              "en": "What",
              "nl": "Wat"
            },
            "values": [
              {
                "id": "camera",
                "label": {
                  "en": "the camera",
                  "nl": "de camera"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "message",
                "label": {
                  "en": "a message",
                  "nl": "een bericht"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "house",
                "label": {
                  "en": "the house",
                  "nl": "het huis"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "level",
                "label": {
                  "en": "a storey",
                  "nl": "een verdieping"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "energy",
                "label": {
                  "en": "the Energy page",
                  "nl": "de Energiepagina"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "name": "detail",
            "title": {
              "en": "Detail",
              "nl": "Detail"
            },
            "required": false,
            "placeholder": {
              "en": "Text or storey",
              "nl": "Tekst of verdieping"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "name": "screen",
            "title": {
              "en": "Screen",
              "nl": "Scherm"
            },
            "required": false,
            "placeholder": {
              "en": "All",
              "nl": "Alle"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "number",
            "name": "seconds",
            "title": {
              "en": "Seconds",
              "nl": "Seconden"
            },
            "min": 0,
            "max": 3600,
            "step": 1,
            "placeholder": {
              "en": "30",
              "nl": "30"
            }
          }
        ],
        "id": "show-on-screen"
      },
      {
        "title": {
          "en": "Shower started",
          "nl": "Douche gestart"
        },
        "hint": {
          "en": "Only used when calibrating the shower minutes is turned on in the app settings. Run it when the shower is turned on.",
          "nl": "Alleen in gebruik als het ijken van de doucheminuten aanstaat in de app-instellingen. Voer het uit als de douche aangaat."
        },
        "id": "shower-start"
      },
      {
        "title": {
          "en": "Shower finished",
          "nl": "Douche klaar"
        },
        "hint": {
          "en": "Only used when calibrating the shower minutes is turned on in the app settings. Run it when the shower is turned off.",
          "nl": "Alleen in gebruik als het ijken van de doucheminuten aanstaat in de app-instellingen. Voer het uit als de douche uitgaat."
        },
        "id": "shower-stop"
      },
      {
        "title": {
          "en": "Hot tap water comes from",
          "nl": "Warm tapwater komt uit"
        },
        "titleFormatted": {
          "en": "Hot tap water comes [[source]] (reason: [[reason]])",
          "nl": "Warm tapwater komt [[source]] (reden: [[reason]])"
        },
        "hint": {
          "en": "Only used when the three-way valve is turned on in the app settings (Water heater). For a three-way valve between the water heater and the gas boiler. Run it after the Flow switched the valve; the Heating block shows the source and the last three switches. It shows what the Flow commanded, not a reading of the valve.",
          "nl": "Alleen in gebruik als de driewegklep aanstaat in de app-instellingen (Boiler). Voor een driewegklep tussen de boiler en de cv-ketel. Voer het uit nadat de Flow de klep heeft omgezet; het blok Verwarming toont de bron en de laatste drie omschakelingen. Het toont wat de Flow opdroeg, geen meting van de klep."
        },
        "args": [
          {
            "name": "source",
            "type": "dropdown",
            "values": [
              {
                "id": "boiler",
                "title": {
                  "en": "straight from the water heater",
                  "nl": "direct uit de boiler"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "cv",
                "title": {
                  "en": "through the gas boiler (reheating)",
                  "nl": "via de cv-ketel (naverwarming)"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "reason",
            "type": "text",
            "required": false,
            "placeholder": {
              "en": "optional",
              "nl": "mag leeg"
            }
          }
        ],
        "id": "tapwater-source"
      }
    ]
